<p data-start=3D"4865" data-end=3D"4942" class=3D"">Les <strong data-start=
=3D"4869" data-end=3D"4879">issues</strong> servent =C3=A0 signaler des bug=
s ou =C3=A0 proposer des am=C3=A9liorations.</p>
<ol data-start=3D"4944" data-end=3D"5171">
<li data-start=3D"4944" data-end=3D"5013" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4947" data-end=3D"5013" class=3D"">Dans votre d=C3=A9p=C3=
=B4t GitHub, cliquez sur <strong data-start=3D"4984" data-end=3D"4994">Issu=
es</strong> &gt; <strong data-start=3D"4997" data-end=3D"5010">New Issue</s=
trong>.</p>
