<li data-start=3D"5014" data-end=3D"5063" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5017" data-end=3D"5063" class=3D"">Ajoutez un <strong data=
-start=3D"5028" data-end=3D"5037">titre</strong> et une <strong data-start=
=3D"5045" data-end=3D"5060">description</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5064" data-end=3D"5132" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5067" data-end=3D"5132" class=3D"">Assignez des personnes,=
 ajoutez des labels ou un projet Kanban.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5133" data-end=3D"5171" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5136" data-end=3D"5171" class=3D"">Cliquez sur <strong dat=
a-start=3D"5148" data-end=3D"5168">Submit new issue</strong>.</p>
</li>
</ol>
