<h2 data-start=3D"2428" data-end=3D"2481" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
2431" data-end=3D"2481">3. Diff=C3=A9rences entre <code data-start=3D"2454"=
 data-end=3D"2465">git fetch</code> et <code data-start=3D"2469" data-end=
