ents du d=C3=A9p=C3=B4t distant et les fusionne imm=C3=A9diatement avec vot=
re branche locale.</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
<h3 data-start=3D"2763" data-end=3D"2796" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
2767" data-end=3D"2796">Exemple de comportement :</strong></h3>
<ol data-start=3D"2797" data-end=3D"3207">
<li data-start=3D"2797" data-end=3D"2905" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2800" data-end=3D"2905" class=3D"">Supposons que la branch=
e distante <code data-start=3D"2834" data-end=3D"2840">main</code> ait re=
=C3=A7u de nouveaux commits depuis la derni=C3=A8re synchronisation.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2906" data-end=3D"3040" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2909" data-end=3D"3040" class=3D"">Si vous ex=C3=A9cutez <=
code data-start=3D"2926" data-end=3D"2944">git fetch origin</code>, Git t=
=C3=A9l=C3=A9charge les nouvelles modifications mais ne met pas =C3=A0 jour=
 votre branche locale <code data-start=3D"3033" data-end=3D"3039">main</cod=
e>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3041" data-end=3D"3207" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3044" data-end=3D"3207" class=3D"">Si vous ex=C3=A9cutez <=
code data-start=3D"3061" data-end=3D"3083">git pull origin main</code>, Git=
 t=C3=A9l=C3=A9charge les nouvelles modifications <strong data-start=3D"312=
8" data-end=3D"3134">et</strong> fusionne imm=C3=A9diatement ces changement=
s avec votre branche locale <code data-start=3D"3200" data-end=3D"3206">mai=
n</code>.</p>
</li>
</ol>
<p data-start=3D"3209" data-end=3D"3260" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
209" data-end=3D"3258">Cas d'utilisation privil=C3=A9gi=C3=A9 de <code data=
-start=3D"3243" data-end=3D"3254">git fetch</code> :</strong></p>
<ul data-start=3D"3261" data-end=3D"3456">
<li data-start=3D"3261" data-end=3D"3352" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3263" data-end=3D"3352" class=3D"">Si vous voulez <strong =
data-start=3D"3278" data-end=3D"3290">v=C3=A9rifier</strong> les nouvelles =
modifications sans les fusionner imm=C3=A9diatement.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3353" data-end=3D"3456" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3355" data-end=3D"3456" class=3D"">Si vous travaillez sur =
une fonctionnalit=C3=A9 et que vous ne voulez pas perturber votre travail e=
n cours.</p>
</li>
</ul>
