3466" data-end=3D"3517">4. V=C3=A9rifier les modifications apr=C3=A8s <code=
 data-start=3D"3504" data-end=3D"3515">git fetch</code></strong></h2>
<p data-start=3D"3518" data-end=3D"3621" class=3D"">Une fois que vous avez =
