=B4t Fork=C3=A9" ?</strong></h2>
<p data-start=3D"653" data-end=3D"967" class=3D"">Le clonage consiste =C3=
=A0 cr=C3=A9er une copie locale d=E2=80=99un d=C3=A9p=C3=B4t Git sur votre =
