<h2 data-start=3D"6803" data-end=3D"6891" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
6806" data-end=3D"6891">6. Bonnes Pratiques pour la Cr=C3=A9ation et la Ges=
tion des Branches de Fonctionnalit=C3=A9</strong></h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"6893" data-end=3D"6957" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
6897" data-end=3D"6957">6.1. Utiliser des Noms de Branches Clairs et Descri=
ptifs</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"6959" data-end=3D"7114" class=3D"">Choisissez des noms de =
branches explicites et coh=C3=A9rents qui indiquent clairement la fonctionn=
alit=C3=A9 ou la t=C3=A2che qu'elles traitent. Voici quelques exemples :</p=
>
<ul data-start=3D"7116" data-end=3D"7213">
<li data-start=3D"7116" data-end=3D"7150" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7118" data-end=3D"7150" class=3D""><code data-start=3D"711=
8" data-end=3D"7150">feature/ajout-authentification</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7151" data-end=3D"7178" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7153" data-end=3D"7178" class=3D""><code data-start=3D"715=
3" data-end=3D"7178">feature/am=C3=A9lioration-ui</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7179" data-end=3D"7213" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7181" data-end=3D"7213" class=3D""><code data-start=3D"718=
