<hr data-start=3D"2802" data-end=3D"2805" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"2807" data-end=3D"2850" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
2810" data-end=3D"2850">4. Cr=C3=A9er une Pull Request sur GitHub</strong><=
/h2>
<p data-start=3D"2852" data-end=3D"3096" class=3D"">Une fois que vous avez =
pouss=C3=A9 votre branche vers GitHub, l=E2=80=99=C3=A9tape suivante consis=
te =C3=A0 cr=C3=A9er une Pull Request pour que d'autres d=C3=A9veloppeurs p=
uissent examiner vos changements et, =C3=A9ventuellement, les fusionner dan=
s la branche principale du projet.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"3098" data-end=3D"3127" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
3102" data-end=3D"3127">4.1. Aller sur GitHub</strong></h3>
<ol data-start=3D"3129" data-end=3D"3513">
<li data-start=3D"3129" data-end=3D"3223" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3132" data-end=3D"3223" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
132" data-end=3D"3149">Ouvrez GitHub</strong> dans votre navigateur et acc=
=C3=A9dez au d=C3=A9p=C3=B4t o=C3=B9 vous avez pouss=C3=A9 la branche.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3224" data-end=3D"3513" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3227" data-end=3D"3356" class=3D"">Vous verrez un bouton "=
Compare &amp; Pull Request" qui appara=C3=AEt juste apr=C3=A8s avoir pouss=
=C3=A9 une nouvelle branche. Cliquez sur ce bouton.</p>
<blockquote data-start=3D"3361" data-end=3D"3513">
<p data-start=3D"3363" data-end=3D"3513" class=3D"">Si vous ne voyez pas ce=
 bouton, vous pouvez =C3=A9galement aller dans l'onglet <strong data-start=
=3D"3437" data-end=3D"3456">"Pull Requests"</strong> de votre d=C3=A9p=C3=
=B4t, puis cliquer sur <strong data-start=3D"3490" data-end=3D"3512">"New P=
ull Request"</strong>.</p>
</blockquote>
</li>
</ol>
<h3 data-start=3D"3515" data-end=3D"3559" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
3519" data-end=3D"3559">4.2. Choisir les branches =C3=A0 comparer</strong><=
/h3>
<ol data-start=3D"3561" data-end=3D"3945">
<li data-start=3D"3561" data-end=3D"3696" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3564" data-end=3D"3696" class=3D"">Dans la section <strong=
 data-start=3D"3580" data-end=3D"3590">"Base"</strong>, s=C3=A9lectionnez l=
a branche vers laquelle vous souhaitez envoyer votre PR (g=C3=A9n=C3=A9rale=
ment <code data-start=3D"3676" data-end=3D"3682">main</code> ou <code data-=
start=3D"3686" data-end=3D"3694">master</code>).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3697" data-end=3D"3945" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3700" data-end=3D"3833" class=3D"">Dans la section <strong=
 data-start=3D"3716" data-end=3D"3729">"Compare"</strong>, assurez-vous que=
 la branche que vous avez cr=C3=A9=C3=A9e (par exemple, <code data-start=3D=
"3793" data-end=3D"3814">feature/ajout-login</code>) est s=C3=A9lectionn=C3=
=A9e.</p>
<p data-start=3D"3841" data-end=3D"3945" class=3D"">GitHub vous montre alor=
s les diff=C3=A9rences entre la branche principale et votre branche de fonc=
tionnalit=C3=A9.</p>
</li>
</ol>
<h3 data-start=3D"3947" data-end=3D"3994" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
3951" data-end=3D"3994">4.3. R=C3=A9diger un message de Pull Request</stron=
g></h3>
<ol data-start=3D"3996" data-end=3D"4695">
<li data-start=3D"3996" data-end=3D"4124" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3999" data-end=3D"4071" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
999" data-end=3D"4008">Titre</strong> : Le titre de la PR doit =C3=AAtre cl=
air et pr=C3=A9cis. Par exemple, :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"4075" data-end=3D"4124">
<li data-start=3D"4075" data-end=3D"4120" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4077" data-end=3D"4120" class=3D"">"Ajout du syst=C3=A8me =
de connexion utilisateur"</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4125" data-end=3D"4695" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4128" data-end=3D"4251" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
128" data-end=3D"4143">Description</strong> : Fournissez une description d=
=C3=A9taill=C3=A9e des changements apport=C3=A9s. Vous pouvez inclure des i=
nformations sur :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"4255" data-end=3D"4414">
<li data-start=3D"4255" data-end=3D"4285" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4257" data-end=3D"4285" class=3D"">Le but de la fonctionna=
lit=C3=A9.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4289" data-end=3D"4321" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4291" data-end=3D"4321" class=3D"">Les parties du code mod=
ifi=C3=A9es.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4325" data-end=3D"4361" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4327" data-end=3D"4361" class=3D"">Les tests que vous avez=
 effectu=C3=A9s.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4365" data-end=3D"4414" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4367" data-end=3D"4414" class=3D"">Les probl=C3=A8mes r=C3=
=A9solus par cette fonctionnalit=C3=A9.</p>
</li>
</ul>
