<ul data-start=3D"2450" data-end=3D"2992">
<li data-start=3D"2450" data-end=3D"2579" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2452" data-end=3D"2579" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
452" data-end=3D"2474">Lisibilit=C3=A9 du code</strong> : Est-ce que le cod=
