<h4 data-start=3D"3654" data-end=3D"3699" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
3659" data-end=3D"3699">Autres Exemples de Fermeture d'Issue</strong></h4>
<ul data-start=3D"3701" data-end=3D"3890">
<li data-start=3D"3701" data-end=3D"3800" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3703" data-end=3D"3800" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
703" data-end=3D"3715"><code data-start=3D"3705" data-end=3D"3713">closes</=
code></strong> :<br data-start=3D"3717" data-end=3D"3720">
<code data-start=3D"3722" data-end=3D"3800">git commit -m "Closes #123: Cor=
rection de l'erreur de connexion utilisateur"</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3804" data-end=3D"3890" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3806" data-end=3D"3890" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
806" data-end=3D"3820"><code data-start=3D"3808" data-end=3D"3818">resolves=
</code></strong> :<br data-start=3D"3822" data-end=3D"3825">
<code data-start=3D"3827" data-end=3D"3890">git commit -m "Resolves #123: R=
=C3=A9solution du bug de connexion"</code></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"3892" data-end=3D"4040" class=3D"">Lorsque vous poussez ce=
 commit sur GitHub, l'issue correspondante sera marqu=C3=A9e comme <strong =
data-start=3D"3977" data-end=3D"3987">ferm=C3=A9e</strong>, et un lien vers=
 le commit sera ajout=C3=A9 dans l'issue.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"4042" data-end=3D"4045" class=3D"">
<h3 data-start=3D"4047" data-end=3D"4112" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
4051" data-end=3D"4112">3.2. R=C3=A9f=C3=A9rencer une Issue dans un Commit =
(sans la fermer)</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"4114" data-end=3D"4352" class=3D"">Si vous ne souhaitez pa=
s fermer l'issue, mais simplement <strong data-start=3D"4171" data-end=3D"4=
188">la r=C3=A9f=C3=A9rencer</strong> dans votre commit pour indiquer que l=
e travail est li=C3=A9 =C3=A0 ce probl=C3=A8me ou cette t=C3=A2che, vous po=
uvez utiliser les mots-cl=C3=A9s <strong data-start=3D"4309" data-end=3D"43=
19"><code data-start=3D"4311" data-end=3D"4317">refs</code></strong>, <stro=
ng data-start=3D"4321" data-end=3D"4330"><code data-start=3D"4323" data-end=
=3D"4328">see</code></strong>, ou <strong data-start=3D"4335" data-end=3D"4=
351"><code data-start=3D"4337" data-end=3D"4349">relates to</code></strong>=
.</p>
<h4 data-start=3D"4354" data-end=3D"4395" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
4359" data-end=3D"4395">Exemple de R=C3=A9f=C3=A9rence =C3=A0 une Issue</st=
rong></h4>
<p data-start=3D"4397" data-end=3D"4572" class=3D"">Disons que vous travail=
lez sur la fonctionnalit=C3=A9 de r=C3=A9initialisation du mot de passe, et=
 vous souhaitez mentionner que votre commit est li=C3=A9 =C3=A0 l'issue <st=
rong data-start=3D"4547" data-end=3D"4555">#124</strong>, sans la fermer.</=
p>
