<h3 data-start=3D"4011" data-end=3D"4051" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
4015" data-end=3D"4051">2.3. Explication du fichier YAML</strong></h3>
<ul data-start=3D"4053" data-end=3D"4926">
<li data-start=3D"4053" data-end=3D"4104" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4055" data-end=3D"4104" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
055" data-end=3D"4063">name</strong> : Le nom du workflow, ici <code data-s=
tart=3D"4090" data-end=3D"4103">CI Workflow</code>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4105" data-end=3D"4276" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4107" data-end=3D"4276" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
107" data-end=3D"4113">on</strong> : D=C3=A9finit les =C3=A9v=C3=A9nements =
qui d=C3=A9clenchent le workflow. Dans cet exemple, il s'ex=C3=A9cute lorsq=
ue vous effectuez un <code data-start=3D"4225" data-end=3D"4231">push</code=
> ou une <code data-start=3D"4239" data-end=3D"4253">pull_request</code> su=
r la branche <code data-start=3D"4269" data-end=3D"4275">main</code>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4277" data-end=3D"4369" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4279" data-end=3D"4369" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
279" data-end=3D"4287">jobs</strong> : Contient l'ensemble des t=C3=A2ches =
=C3=A0 ex=C3=A9cuter. Ici, nous avons un job nomm=C3=A9 <code data-start=3D=
"4362" data-end=3D"4368">test</code>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4370" data-end=3D"4548" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4372" data-end=3D"4548" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
372" data-end=3D"4383">runs-on</strong> : Sp=C3=A9cifie l'environnement sur=
 lequel les actions seront ex=C3=A9cut=C3=A9es. Nous avons choisi <code dat=
a-start=3D"4470" data-end=3D"4485">ubuntu-latest</code>, mais d'autres envi=
ronnements sont possibles (Windows, macOS).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4549" data-end=3D"4926" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4551" data-end=3D"4604" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
551" data-end=3D"4560">steps</strong> : Ce sont les =C3=A9tapes du job, qui=
 incluent :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"4607" data-end=3D"4926">
<li data-start=3D"4607" data-end=3D"4704" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4609" data-end=3D"4704" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
609" data-end=3D"4626">Checkout code</strong> : Utilise l'action <code data=
-start=3D"4646" data-end=3D"4664">actions/checkout</code> pour r=C3=A9cup=
=C3=A9rer le code source du d=C3=A9p=C3=B4t.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4707" data-end=3D"4798" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4709" data-end=3D"4798" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
709" data-end=3D"4727">Set up Node.js</strong> : Configure l'environnement =
Node.js pour ex=C3=A9cuter des commandes <code data-start=3D"4792" data-end=
=3D"4797">npm</code>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4801" data-end=3D"4873" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4803" data-end=3D"4873" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
803" data-end=3D"4827">Install dependencies</strong> : Installe les d=C3=A9=
pendances via <code data-start=3D"4859" data-end=3D"4872">npm install</code=
>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4876" data-end=3D"4926" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4878" data-end=3D"4926" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
878" data-end=3D"4891">Run tests</strong> : Lance les tests avec <code data=
-start=3D"4915" data-end=3D"4925">npm test</code>.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
