1315" data-end=3D"1333">2.1. Pr=C3=A9requis</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"1335" data-end=3D"1377" class=3D"">Avant de commencer, ass=
urez-vous d'avoir :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"1379" data-end=3D"1696">
<li data-start=3D"1379" data-end=3D"1410" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1381" data-end=3D"1410" class=3D"">Un projet h=C3=A9berg=
=C3=A9 sur GitHub.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1411" data-end=3D"1558" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1413" data-end=3D"1558" class=3D"">Des tests automatis=C3=
=A9s configur=C3=A9s pour votre projet (par exemple, des tests unitaires av=
ec des outils comme <strong data-start=3D"1520" data-end=3D"1528">Jest</str=
ong>, <strong data-start=3D"1530" data-end=3D"1539">Mocha</strong>, <strong=
 data-start=3D"1541" data-end=3D"1550">JUnit</strong>, etc.).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1559" data-end=3D"1696" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1561" data-end=3D"1696" class=3D"">Un environnement de d=
=C3=A9ploiement configur=C3=A9 (par exemple, un serveur distant ou un servi=
ce comme <strong data-start=3D"1656" data-end=3D"1666">Heroku</strong>, <st=
rong data-start=3D"1668" data-end=3D"1675">AWS</strong>, <strong data-start=
=3D"1677" data-end=3D"1688">Netlify</strong>, etc.).</p>
</li>
</ul>
