<li data-start=3D"7924" data-end=3D"7963" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7926" data-end=3D"7963" class=3D"">Cr=C3=A9er et configure=
r un projet GitHub.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7964" data-end=3D"8021" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7966" data-end=3D"8021" class=3D"">Ajouter et organiser de=
s cartes dans un tableau Kanban.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"8022" data-end=3D"8108" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"8024" data-end=3D"8108" class=3D"">Utiliser des labels, de=
s milestones, et des filtres pour mieux organiser le travail.</p>
