<li data-start=3D"1966" data-end=3D"2025" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1969" data-end=3D"2025" class=3D"">Cliquez sur l'onglet <s=
trong data-start=3D"1990" data-end=3D"2002">Projects</strong> dans le menu =
du d=C3=A9p=C3=B4t.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2026" data-end=3D"2082" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2029" data-end=3D"2082" class=3D"">Cliquez sur <strong dat=
a-start=3D"2041" data-end=3D"2056">New Project</strong> pour en cr=C3=A9er =
un nouveau.</p>
</li>
</ol>
<h3 data-start=3D"2084" data-end=3D"2119" class=3D"">2.2 <strong data-start=
=3D"2092" data-end=3D"2119">Configurer votre Projet</strong></h3>
