z si votre projet est <strong data-start=3D"2441" data-end=3D"2451">public<=
/strong> ou <strong data-start=3D"2455" data-end=3D"2464">priv=C3=A9</stron=
g>.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"2467" data-end=3D"2518" class=3D"">Une fois configur=C3=A9=
, cliquez sur <strong data-start=3D"2499" data-end=3D"2517">Create Project<=
/strong>.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"2520" data-end=3D"2523" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"2525" data-end=3D"2576" class=3D"">3. <strong data-start=
=3D"2531" data-end=3D"2576">Comprendre l=E2=80=99Interface de GitHub Projec=
ts</strong></h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"2578" data-end=3D"2616" class=3D"">3.1 <strong data-start=
=3D"2586" data-end=3D"2616">Colonnes du Tableau Kanban</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"2617" data-end=3D"2669" class=3D"">Par d=C3=A9faut, GitHub=
 Projects propose trois colonnes :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"2670" data-end=3D"2837">
<li data-start=3D"2670" data-end=3D"2725" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2672" data-end=3D"2725" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
672" data-end=3D"2691">To do (=C3=80 faire)</strong> : La liste des t=C3=A2=
ches =C3=A0 r=C3=A9aliser.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2726" data-end=3D"2792" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2728" data-end=3D"2792" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
728" data-end=3D"2754">In progress (En cours)</strong> : Les t=C3=A2ches en=
 cours de r=C3=A9alisation.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2793" data-end=3D"2837" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2795" data-end=3D"2837" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
795" data-end=3D"2813">Done (Termin=C3=A9)</strong> : Les t=C3=A2ches termi=
n=C3=A9es.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"2839" data-end=3D"3002" class=3D"">Ces colonnes sont perso=
nnalisables et peuvent =C3=AAtre modifi=C3=A9es pour mieux correspondre =C3=
=A0 votre flux de travail. Par exemple, vous pouvez ajouter des colonnes co=
mme :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"3003" data-end=3D"3173">
<li data-start=3D"3003" data-end=3D"3100" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3005" data-end=3D"3100" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
005" data-end=3D"3032">In Review (En r=C3=A9vision)</strong> : Pour les t=
=C3=A2ches qui sont termin=C3=A9es mais n=C3=A9cessitent une r=C3=A9vision.=
</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3101" data-end=3D"3173" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3103" data-end=3D"3173" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
103" data-end=3D"3123">Blocked (Bloqu=C3=A9)</strong> : Pour les t=C3=A2che=
s en pause =C3=A0 cause d'un obstacle.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"3175" data-end=3D"3193" class=3D"">3.2 <strong data-start=
=3D"3183" data-end=3D"3193">Cartes</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"3194" data-end=3D"3287" class=3D"">Les <strong data-start=
=3D"3198" data-end=3D"3208">cartes</strong> repr=C3=A9sentent les t=C3=A2ch=
es sp=C3=A9cifiques dans chaque colonne. Une carte peut =C3=AAtre :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"3288" data-end=3D"3481">
<li data-start=3D"3288" data-end=3D"3343" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3290" data-end=3D"3343" class=3D"">Une <strong data-start=
=3D"3294" data-end=3D"3303">issue</strong> (probl=C3=A8me ou fonctionnalit=
=C3=A9 =C3=A0 ajouter).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3344" data-end=3D"3401" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3346" data-end=3D"3401" class=3D"">Une <strong data-start=
=3D"3350" data-end=3D"3366">pull request</strong> (modification du code =C3=
=A0 int=C3=A9grer).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3402" data-end=3D"3481" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3404" data-end=3D"3481" class=3D"">Une <strong data-start=
=3D"3408" data-end=3D"3416">note</strong> (=C3=A9l=C3=A9ment de r=C3=A9flex=
ion ou t=C3=A2che non li=C3=A9e =C3=A0 une issue sp=C3=A9cifique).</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"3483" data-end=3D"3596" class=3D"">Les cartes peuvent =C3=
=AAtre d=C3=A9plac=C3=A9es entre les colonnes pour refl=C3=A9ter leur =C3=
=A9tat actuel dans le processus de travail.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"3598" data-end=3D"3601" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"3603" data-end=3D"3651" class=3D"">4. <strong data-start=
=3D"3609" data-end=3D"3651">Organiser les T=C3=A2ches avec les Colonnes</st=
rong></h2>
<p data-start=3D"3653" data-end=3D"3806" class=3D"">Les colonnes sont l=E2=
=80=99un des =C3=A9l=C3=A9ments cl=C3=A9s de votre tableau Kanban. Elles pe=
rmettent de structurer le flux de travail et de suivre l'avancement des t=
=C3=A2ches.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"3808" data-end=3D"3839" class=3D"">4.1 <strong data-start=
