<li data-start=3D"9387" data-end=3D"9444" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"9389" data-end=3D"9444" class=3D"">Automatiser les t=C3=A2=
ches r=C3=A9p=C3=A9titives avec GitHub Actions.</p>
