<h3 data-start=3D"1147" data-end=3D"1169" class=3D"">1.1 <strong data-start=
=3D"1155" data-end=3D"1169">D=C3=A9finition</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"1170" data-end=3D"1497" class=3D"">Une <strong data-start=
