</li>
<li data-start=3D"4234" data-end=3D"4336" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4237" data-end=3D"4336" class=3D"">Connectez-vous =C3=A0 v=
otre compte GitHub, puis acc=C3=A9dez =C3=A0 <strong data-start=3D"4290" da=
ta-end=3D"4335">Settings &gt; SSH and GPG keys &gt; New SSH key</strong>.</=
p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4337" data-end=3D"4447" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4340" data-end=3D"4447" class=3D"">Donnez un nom =C3=A0 la=
 cl=C3=A9 (par exemple, "Cl=C3=A9 de mon PC"), puis collez la cl=C3=A9 publ=
ique dans le champ appropri=C3=A9.</p>
