<h2 data-start=3D"4860" data-end=3D"4925" class=3D"">3. <strong data-start=
=3D"4866" data-end=3D"4925">Configurer et Utiliser un Token d'Acc=C3=A8s Pe=
rsonnel (PAT)</strong></h2>
<p data-start=3D"4927" data-end=3D"5079" class=3D"">Les tokens d'acc=C3=A8s=
 sont utilis=C3=A9s pour l'authentification dans les op=C3=A9rations Git et=
 API lorsque l'utilisation du mot de passe est d=C3=A9sactiv=C3=A9e par Git=
Hub.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"5081" data-end=3D"5127" class=3D"">3.1 <strong data-start=
=3D"5089" data-end=3D"5127">G=C3=A9n=C3=A9rer un Token d'Acc=C3=A8s Personn=
el</strong></h3>
<h4 data-start=3D"5128" data-end=3D"5167" class=3D"">3.1.1 <strong data-sta=
rt=3D"5139" data-end=3D"5167">=C3=89tape 1 : Cr=C3=A9er un Token</strong></=
h4>
<ol data-start=3D"5168" data-end=3D"5591">
<li data-start=3D"5168" data-end=3D"5222" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5171" data-end=3D"5222" class=3D"">Allez dans les <strong =
data-start=3D"5186" data-end=3D"5198">Settings</strong> de votre compte Git=
Hub.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5223" data-end=3D"5319" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5226" data-end=3D"5319" class=3D"">Dans le menu lat=C3=A9r=
al gauche, cliquez sur <strong data-start=3D"5267" data-end=3D"5289">Develo=
per settings</strong> &gt; <strong data-start=3D"5292" data-end=3D"5318">Pe=
rsonal access tokens</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5320" data-end=3D"5358" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5323" data-end=3D"5358" class=3D"">Cliquez sur <strong dat=
a-start=3D"5335" data-end=3D"5357">Generate new token</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5359" data-end=3D"5421" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5362" data-end=3D"5421" class=3D"">Donnez un <strong data-=
start=3D"5372" data-end=3D"5379">nom</strong> au token (par exemple, "Token=
 pour Git").</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5422" data-end=3D"5591" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5425" data-end=3D"5591" class=3D"">S=C3=A9lectionnez les <=
strong data-start=3D"5442" data-end=3D"5457">permissions</strong> que vous =
souhaitez accorder =C3=A0 ce token. Par exemple, pour pouvoir effectuer des=
 <code data-start=3D"5538" data-end=3D"5548">git push</code>, vous devez co=
cher la permission <strong data-start=3D"5582" data-end=3D"5590">repo</stro=
ng>.</p>
</li>
</ol>
<h4 data-start=3D"5593" data-end=3D"5638" class=3D"">3.1.2 <strong data-sta=
rt=3D"5604" data-end=3D"5638">=C3=89tape 2 : Sauvegarder le Token</strong><=
/h4>
<p data-start=3D"5639" data-end=3D"5761" class=3D"">Apr=C3=A8s avoir config=
ur=C3=A9 les permissions, cliquez sur <strong data-start=3D"5690" data-end=
=3D"5708">Generate token</strong>. GitHub g=C3=A9n=C3=A8re alors un token q=
ui ressemble =C3=A0 ceci :</p>
