(CD).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"978" data-end=3D"1043" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"980" data-end=3D"1043" class=3D"">Configurer un pipeline C=
I/CD simple =C3=A0 l=E2=80=99aide de GitHub Actions.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1044" data-end=3D"1119" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1046" data-end=3D"1119" class=3D"">Ajouter des =C3=A9tapes=
