<p data-start=3D"2780" data-end=3D"2848" class=3D"">Avant de commencer, ass=
urez-vous de disposer des =C3=A9l=C3=A9ments suivants :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"2849" data-end=3D"3043">
<li data-start=3D"2849" data-end=3D"2872" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2851" data-end=3D"2872" class=3D"">Un <strong data-start=
=3D"2854" data-end=3D"2871">compte GitHub</strong>.</p>
