<h4 data-start=3D"4554" data-end=3D"4584" class=3D"">Explication du Workflo=
w :</h4>
<ul data-start=3D"4585" data-end=3D"5011">
<li data-start=3D"4585" data-end=3D"4746" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4587" data-end=3D"4746" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
587" data-end=3D"4617">on.push et on.pull_request</strong> : Le pipeline s'=
ex=C3=A9cute lorsqu'un commit est effectu=C3=A9 sur la branche <code data-s=
tart=3D"4687" data-end=3D"4693">main</code>, ou lorsqu'une pull request est=
 ouverte vers <code data-start=3D"4739" data-end=3D"4745">main</code>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4747" data-end=3D"4843" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4749" data-end=3D"4843" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
749" data-end=3D"4763">jobs.build</strong> : Ce job ex=C3=A9cute l'installa=
tion des d=C3=A9pendances Node.js et les tests unitaires.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4844" data-end=3D"5011" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4846" data-end=3D"5011" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
846" data-end=3D"4861">jobs.deploy</strong> : Le job de d=C3=A9ploiement s'=
ex=C3=A9cute apr=C3=A8s le job <code data-start=3D"4909" data-end=3D"4916">=
build</code> et uniquement si le job de build r=C3=A9ussit. Ce job d=C3=A9p=
loie le code sur un serveur de production.</p>
</li>
</ul>
