workflow GitHub Actions pour automatiser l'ex=C3=A9cution des tests.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"847" data-end=3D"911" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"849" data-end=3D"911" class=3D"">Int=C3=A9grer des tests u=
nitaires avec un framework comme <strong data-start=3D"902" data-end=3D"910=
">Jest</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"912" data-end=3D"981" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"914" data-end=3D"981" class=3D"">Visualiser les r=C3=A9sul=
