<li data-start=3D"5637" data-end=3D"5725" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5639" data-end=3D"5725" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
639" data-end=3D"5664">Tests de bout en bout</strong> : Testez des fonction=
nalit=C3=A9s compl=C3=A8tes de votre application.</p>
