<ul data-start=3D"975" data-end=3D"1392">
<li data-start=3D"975" data-end=3D"1031" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"977" data-end=3D"1031" class=3D"">Un <strong data-start=3D=
"980" data-end=3D"997">compte GitHub</strong> et un d=C3=A9p=C3=B4t contena=
nt votre code.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1032" data-end=3D"1130" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1034" data-end=3D"1130" class=3D"">Un <strong data-start=
=3D"1037" data-end=3D"1054">compte Heroku</strong>, <strong data-start=3D"1=
056" data-end=3D"1063">AWS</strong> ou <strong data-start=3D"1067" data-end=
=3D"1076">Azure</strong>, selon le service sur lequel vous souhaitez d=C3=
=A9ployer.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1131" data-end=3D"1252" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1133" data-end=3D"1252" class=3D"">L'application que vous =
souhaitez d=C3=A9ployer doit =C3=AAtre pr=C3=AAte (par exemple, une applica=
