<h3 data-start=3D"1467" data-end=3D"1507" class=3D"">2.1 <strong data-start=
=3D"1475" data-end=3D"1507">Cr=C3=A9er une Application Heroku</strong></h3>
<ol data-start=3D"1509" data-end=3D"1701">
<li data-start=3D"1509" data-end=3D"1619" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1512" data-end=3D"1619" class=3D"">Allez sur <a data-start=
=3D"1522" data-end=3D"1550" rel=3D"noopener" target=3D"_new" class=3D"" hre=
f=3D"https://heroku.com/">Heroku</a>, connectez-vous =C3=A0 votre compte, p=
uis cr=C3=A9ez une nouvelle application.</p>
