<h3 data-start=3D"2758" data-end=3D"2798" class=3D"">2.3 <strong data-start=
=3D"2766" data-end=3D"2798">Ajouter des Secrets =C3=A0 GitHub</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"2800" data-end=3D"2905" class=3D"">GitHub Actions utilise =
des secrets pour s=C3=A9curiser les cl=C3=A9s API et les informations sensi=
bles. Pour cela :</p>
<ol data-start=3D"2907" data-end=3D"3225">
<li data-start=3D"2907" data-end=3D"2940" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2910" data-end=3D"2940" class=3D"">Allez dans votre d=C3=
=A9p=C3=B4t GitHub.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2941" data-end=3D"3010" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2944" data-end=3D"3010" class=3D"">Allez dans <strong data=
-start=3D"2955" data-end=3D"2967">Settings</strong> =E2=86=92 <strong data-=
start=3D"2970" data-end=3D"2995">Secrets and variables</strong> =E2=86=92 <=
strong data-start=3D"2998" data-end=3D"3009">Actions</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3011" data-end=3D"3225" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3014" data-end=3D"3044" class=3D"">Ajoutez les secrets sui=
vants :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"3048" data-end=3D"3225">
<li data-start=3D"3048" data-end=3D"3162" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3050" data-end=3D"3162" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
050" data-end=3D"3068">HEROKU_API_KEY</strong> : Votre cl=C3=A9 API Heroku =
(obtenue dans votre tableau de bord Heroku sous <strong data-start=3D"3140"=
 data-end=3D"3160">Account Settings</strong>).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3166" data-end=3D"3225" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3168" data-end=3D"3225" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
168" data-end=3D"3187">HEROKU_APP_NAME</strong> : Le nom de votre applicati=
on Heroku.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ol>
