<p data-start=3D"9030" data-end=3D"9102" class=3D"">Vous apportez des chang=
ements majeurs =C3=A0 l'API, brisant la compatibilit=C3=A9.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"9103" data-end=3D"9141" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"9106" data-end=3D"9141" class=3D"">Version apr=C3=A8s chan=
gement : <code data-start=3D"9133" data-end=3D"9140">2.0.0</code>.</p>
</li>
</ol>
<h3 data-start=3D"9143" data-end=3D"9194" class=3D"">Exemple 2 : Ajout d'un=
