<p data-start=3D"9199" data-end=3D"9226" class=3D"">Version actuelle : <cod=
e data-start=3D"9218" data-end=3D"9225">1.3.0</code>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"9227" data-end=3D"9301" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"9230" data-end=3D"9301" class=3D"">Vous ajoutez une nouvel=
le fonctionnalit=C3=A9 sans affecter l'API existante.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"9302" data-end=3D"9340" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"9305" data-end=3D"9340" class=3D"">Version apr=C3=A8s chan=
gement : <code data-start=3D"9332" data-end=3D"9339">1.4.0</code>.</p>
</li>
</ol>
<h3 data-start=3D"9342" data-end=3D"9375" class=3D"">Exemple 3 : Correction=
 de bug</h3>
<ol data-start=3D"9377" data-end=3D"9497">
<li data-start=3D"9377" data-end=3D"9407" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"9380" data-end=3D"9407" class=3D"">Version actuelle : <cod=
