</li>
<li data-start=3D"9408" data-end=3D"9458" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"9411" data-end=3D"9458" class=3D"">Vous corrigez un bug mi=
neur sans changer l'API.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"9459" data-end=3D"9497" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"9462" data-end=3D"9497" class=3D"">Version apr=C3=A8s corr=
ection : <code data-start=3D"9489" data-end=3D"9496">1.2.5</code>.</p>
