<h2 data-start=3D"5930" data-end=3D"5976" class=3D"">3. <strong data-start=
=3D"5936" data-end=3D"5976">Les Principales Licences Open Source</strong></=
h2>
<p data-start=3D"5978" data-end=3D"6065" class=3D"">Voici un aper=C3=A7u de=
