<li data-start=3D"4254" data-end=3D"4334" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4256" data-end=3D"4334" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
256" data-end=3D"4278">Un =C3=A9diteur de code</strong> : Visual Studio Cod=
e, IntelliJ IDEA, Sublime Text, etc.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4335" data-end=3D"4390" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4337" data-end=3D"4390" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
337" data-end=3D"4344">Git</strong> : Un syst=C3=A8me de gestion de version=
 distribu=C3=A9.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4391" data-end=3D"4489" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4393" data-end=3D"4489" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
393" data-end=3D"4413">Un compte GitHub</strong> : La plateforme la plus co=
urante pour l'h=C3=A9bergement de projets open-source.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4490" data-end=3D"4554" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4492" data-end=3D"4554" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
492" data-end=3D"4517">Une ligne de commande</strong> : Pour interagir avec=
 Git et GitHub.</p>
</li>
</ul>
