<hr data-start=3D"6587" data-end=3D"6590" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"6592" data-end=3D"6625" class=3D"">3. <strong data-start=
=3D"6598" data-end=3D"6625">G=C3=A9rer les Contributions</strong></h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"6627" data-end=3D"6672" class=3D"">3.1. <strong data-star=
t=3D"6636" data-end=3D"6672">Accepter les pull requests (PRs)</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"6674" data-end=3D"6862" class=3D"">Lorsqu'une pull request=
 (PR) est ouverte, le mainteneur doit l'examiner pour s'assurer que le code=
 respecte les lignes directrices et les normes du projet. L'examen de la PR=
 peut inclure :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"6864" data-end=3D"6992">
<li data-start=3D"6864" data-end=3D"6905" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6866" data-end=3D"6905" class=3D"">La v=C3=A9rification de=
 la validit=C3=A9 du code.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6906" data-end=3D"6947" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6908" data-end=3D"6947" class=3D"">La discussion des chang=
ements apport=C3=A9s.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6948" data-end=3D"6992" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6950" data-end=3D"6992" class=3D"">L'ajout de commentaires=
 et de suggestions.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"6994" data-end=3D"7043" class=3D"">3.2. <strong data-star=
t=3D"7003" data-end=3D"7043">R=C3=A9vision de code et bonnes pratiques</str=
ong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"7045" data-end=3D"7095" class=3D"">Lors de la r=C3=A9visio=
n de code, il est important de :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"7097" data-end=3D"7274">
<li data-start=3D"7097" data-end=3D"7137" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7099" data-end=3D"7137" class=3D"">Commenter sur les choix=
 de conception.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7138" data-end=3D"7208" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7140" data-end=3D"7208" class=3D"">V=C3=A9rifier que le co=
de respecte les bonnes pratiques de programmation.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7209" data-end=3D"7274" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7211" data-end=3D"7274" class=3D"">Tester le code localeme=
nt pour v=C3=A9rifier son bon fonctionnement.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"7276" data-end=3D"7327" class=3D"">3.3. <strong data-star=
t=3D"7285" data-end=3D"7327">G=C3=A9rer les probl=C3=A8mes et les discussio=
ns</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"7329" data-end=3D"7456" class=3D"">Les issues doivent =C3=
=AAtre bien document=C3=A9es, et les discussions autour des probl=C3=A8mes =
doivent =C3=AAtre courtoises. Le mainteneur doit :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"7458" data-end=3D"7619">
<li data-start=3D"7458" data-end=3D"7516" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7460" data-end=3D"7516" class=3D"">Triage des issues ouver=
tes pour attribuer des priorit=C3=A9s.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7517" data-end=3D"7567" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7519" data-end=3D"7567" class=3D"">R=C3=A9pondre rapidemen=
t et clairement aux questions.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7568" data-end=3D"7619" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7570" data-end=3D"7619" class=3D"">R=C3=A9soudre les probl=
=C3=A8mes dans un d=C3=A9lai raisonnable.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"7621" data-end=3D"7624" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"7626" data-end=3D"7665" class=3D"">4. <strong data-start=
=3D"7632" data-end=3D"7665">Suivi et Gestion des Versions</strong></h2>
