<li data-start=3D"6516" data-end=3D"6612" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6518" data-end=3D"6612" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
518" data-end=3D"6551">Param=C3=A9trage des notifications</strong> : Config=
urez l'email et les notifications pour votre =C3=A9quipe.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"6614" data-end=3D"6670" class=3D"">2.4. <strong data-star=
