<h3 data-start=3D"4525" data-end=3D"4582" class=3D"">2.2. <strong data-star=
t=3D"4534" data-end=3D"4582">Cr=C3=A9er un D=C3=A9p=C3=B4t Priv=C3=A9 sur G=
itLab ou Bitbucket</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"4584" data-end=3D"4637" class=3D"">Les =C3=A9tapes sont si=
milaires dans GitLab ou Bitbucket :</p>
<ol data-start=3D"4639" data-end=3D"4910">
<li data-start=3D"4639" data-end=3D"4689" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4642" data-end=3D"4689" class=3D"">Connectez-vous =C3=A0 v=
otre compte GitLab/Bitbucket.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4690" data-end=3D"4775" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4693" data-end=3D"4775" class=3D"">Allez dans le tableau d=
e bord des projets et cliquez sur <strong data-start=3D"4750" data-end=3D"4=
774">"Create new project"</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4776" data-end=3D"4825" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4779" data-end=3D"4825" class=3D"">Choisissez <strong data=
-start=3D"4790" data-end=3D"4803">"Private"</strong> comme type de projet.<=
/p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4826" data-end=3D"4910" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4829" data-end=3D"4910" class=3D"">Suivez les =C3=A9tapes =
de cr=C3=A9ation et de configuration, puis cliquez sur <strong data-start=
=3D"4897" data-end=3D"4909">"Create"</strong>.</p>
</li>
</ol>
