<h2 data-start=3D"5390" data-end=3D"5435" class=3D"">3. <strong data-start=
=3D"5396" data-end=3D"5435">Gestion des Acc=C3=A8s aux D=C3=A9p=C3=B4ts Pri=
v=C3=A9s</strong></h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"5437" data-end=3D"5496" class=3D"">3.1. <strong data-star=
t=3D"5446" data-end=3D"5496">Gestion des Permissions dans GitHub Enterprise=
</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"5498" data-end=3D"5555" class=3D"">GitHub Enterprise perme=
t une gestion fine des acc=C3=A8s via :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"5557" data-end=3D"5901">
<li data-start=3D"5557" data-end=3D"5672" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5559" data-end=3D"5672" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
559" data-end=3D"5570">=C3=89quipes</strong> : Organisez les utilisateurs e=
n =C3=A9quipes et attribuez-leur des r=C3=B4les sp=C3=A9cifiques (admin, wr=
ite, read).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5673" data-end=3D"5771" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5675" data-end=3D"5771" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
675" data-end=3D"5693">Collaborateurs</strong> : Ajoutez des collaborateurs=
 individuels et d=C3=A9finissez leurs niveaux d'acc=C3=A8s.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5772" data-end=3D"5901" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5774" data-end=3D"5901" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
774" data-end=3D"5801">Branch Protection Rules</strong> : Mettez en place d=
es r=C3=A8gles de protection de branche pour =C3=A9viter les modifications =
non contr=C3=B4l=C3=A9es.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"5903" data-end=3D"5951" class=3D"">3.2. <strong data-star=
t=3D"5912" data-end=3D"5951">Gestion des Permissions dans GitLab</strong></=
h3>
<p data-start=3D"5953" data-end=3D"6064" class=3D"">Dans GitLab, les permis=
sions sont g=C3=A9r=C3=A9es via les <strong data-start=3D"6002" data-end=3D=
"6013">Groupes</strong>, les <strong data-start=3D"6019" data-end=3D"6030">=
Projets</strong>, et les <strong data-start=3D"6039" data-end=3D"6062">R=C3=
=B4les d'utilisateur</strong> :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"6066" data-end=3D"6368">
<li data-start=3D"6066" data-end=3D"6195" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6068" data-end=3D"6195" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
068" data-end=3D"6117">Guest, Reporter, Developer, Maintainer, Owner</stron=
g> : Les r=C3=B4les d=C3=A9finissent ce que les utilisateurs peuvent faire =
dans un projet.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6196" data-end=3D"6368" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6198" data-end=3D"6368" class=3D"">Vous pouvez attribuer d=
es <strong data-start=3D"6224" data-end=3D"6245">r=C3=B4les sp=C3=A9cifique=
s</strong> aux membres du projet pour g=C3=A9rer qui peut cr=C3=A9er des br=
anches, effectuer des fusions, ou modifier les param=C3=A8tres du projet.</=
p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"6370" data-end=3D"6411" class=3D"">3.3. <strong data-star=
t=3D"6379" data-end=3D"6411">Authentification et Cl=C3=A9s SSH</strong></h3=
>
<p data-start=3D"6413" data-end=3D"6692" class=3D"">L'authentification SSH =
