<h3 data-start=3D"6966" data-end=3D"7020" class=3D"">3.4. <strong data-star=
t=3D"6975" data-end=3D"7020">Gestion des Collaborateurs et des =C3=89quipes=
</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"7022" data-end=3D"7150" class=3D"">Vous pouvez inviter des=
 collaborateurs et g=C3=A9rer les =C3=A9quipes via les interfaces de GitHub=
 Enterprise ou GitLab. Assurez-vous de :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"7152" data-end=3D"7251">
<li data-start=3D"7152" data-end=3D"7196" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7154" data-end=3D"7196" class=3D"">D=C3=A9finir les r=C3=
=B4les de chaque collaborateur.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7197" data-end=3D"7251" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7199" data-end=3D"7251" class=3D"">Limiter l'acc=C3=A8s au=
x branches sensibles ou critiques.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"7253" data-end=3D"7256" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"7258" data-end=3D"7298" class=3D"">4. <strong data-start=
=3D"7264" data-end=3D"7298">S=C3=A9curisation des D=C3=A9p=C3=B4ts Priv=C3=
=A9s</strong></h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"7300" data-end=3D"7351" class=3D"">4.1. <strong data-star=
t=3D"7309" data-end=3D"7351">Authentification =C3=A0 Deux Facteurs (2FA)</s=
trong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"7353" data-end=3D"7533" class=3D"">La mise en place de <st=
rong data-start=3D"7373" data-end=3D"7417">l'authentification =C3=A0 deux f=
acteurs (2FA)</strong> est essentielle pour ajouter un niveau de s=C3=A9cur=
it=C3=A9 suppl=C3=A9mentaire pour les utilisateurs acc=C3=A9dant aux d=C3=
=A9p=C3=B4ts priv=C3=A9s.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"7535" data-end=3D"7616" class=3D"">4.2. <strong data-star=
t=3D"7544" data-end=3D"7616">V=C3=A9rification de la S=C3=A9curit=C3=A9 du =
Code avec Dependabot et Code Scanning</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"7618" data-end=3D"7700" class=3D"">GitHub Enterprise et Gi=
tLab offrent des outils pour v=C3=A9rifier la s=C3=A9curit=C3=A9 du code :<=
/p>
<ul data-start=3D"7702" data-end=3D"7900">
<li data-start=3D"7702" data-end=3D"7788" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7704" data-end=3D"7788" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"7=
704" data-end=3D"7718">Dependabot</strong> : Analyse les d=C3=A9pendances d=
u projet pour d=C3=A9tecter les vuln=C3=A9rabilit=C3=A9s.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7789" data-end=3D"7900" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7791" data-end=3D"7900" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"7=
791" data-end=3D"7808">Code Scanning</strong> : Utilise des outils comme <s=
trong data-start=3D"7836" data-end=3D"7846">CodeQL</strong> pour identifier=
 des failles de s=C3=A9curit=C3=A9 dans le code.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"7902" data-end=3D"7942" class=3D"">4.3. <strong data-star=
t=3D"7911" data-end=3D"7942">Contr=C3=B4le d'Acc=C3=A8s Granulaire</strong>=
</h3>
<p data-start=3D"7944" data-end=3D"8106" class=3D"">Les param=C3=A8tres de =
s=C3=A9curit=C3=A9 permettent de limiter les permissions =C3=A0 un niveau t=
r=C3=A8s granulaire, tel que l'acc=C3=A8s en lecture ou =C3=A9criture sur d=
es branches sp=C3=A9cifiques.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"8108" data-end=3D"8111" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"8113" data-end=3D"8164" class=3D"">5. <strong data-start=
=3D"8119" data-end=3D"8164">Utilisation des Branches et des Workflows</stro=
ng></h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"8166" data-end=3D"8199" class=3D"">5.1. <strong data-star=
t=3D"8175" data-end=3D"8199">Gestion des Branches</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"8201" data-end=3D"8385" class=3D"">Cr=C3=A9ez des branches=
 de fonctionnalit=C3=A9, effectuez des commits, et g=C3=A9rez les fusions e=
n utilisant des outils comme les Pull Requests (PR) sur GitHub ou les Merge=
 Requests (MR) sur GitLab.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"8387" data-end=3D"8418" class=3D"">5.2. <strong data-star=
t=3D"8396" data-end=3D"8418">CI/CD et Workflows</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"8420" data-end=3D"8570" class=3D"">GitHub Actions et GitLa=
b CI permettent d'automatiser les tests et les d=C3=A9ploiements, am=C3=A9l=
iorant ainsi la productivit=C3=A9 et la fiabilit=C3=A9 des d=C3=A9ploiement=
s.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"8572" data-end=3D"8575" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"8577" data-end=3D"8627" class=3D"">6. <strong data-start=
=3D"8583" data-end=3D"8627">Surveillance et Audits des D=C3=A9p=C3=B4ts Pri=
v=C3=A9s</strong></h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"8629" data-end=3D"8679" class=3D"">6.1. <strong data-star=
t=3D"8638" data-end=3D"8679">Logs et Audits dans GitHub Enterprise</strong>=
</h3>
<p data-start=3D"8681" data-end=3D"8801" class=3D"">GitHub Enterprise perme=
t de suivre les activit=C3=A9s des utilisateurs via des logs d=E2=80=99audi=
t, qui peuvent =C3=AAtre utilis=C3=A9s pour :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"8803" data-end=3D"8883">
<li data-start=3D"8803" data-end=3D"8844" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"8805" data-end=3D"8844" class=3D"">Suivre les actions des =
administrateurs.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"8845" data-end=3D"8883" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"8847" data-end=3D"8883" class=3D"">Auditer les acc=C3=A8s =
aux d=C3=A9p=C3=B4ts priv=C3=A9s.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"8885" data-end=3D"8929" class=3D"">6.2. <strong data-star=
t=3D"8894" data-end=3D"8929">Suivi des Activit=C3=A9s dans GitLab</strong><=
/h3>
<p data-start=3D"8931" data-end=3D"9075" class=3D"">GitLab fournit une fonc=
tionnalit=C3=A9 de journalisation compl=C3=A8te pour surveiller les activit=
=C3=A9s des utilisateurs et d=C3=A9tecter toute activit=C3=A9 suspecte.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"9077" data-end=3D"9080" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"9082" data-end=3D"9136" class=3D"">7. <strong data-start=
=3D"9088" data-end=3D"9136">Sauvegarde et R=C3=A9cup=C3=A9ration des D=C3=
=A9p=C3=B4ts Priv=C3=A9s</strong></h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"9138" data-end=3D"9195" class=3D"">7.1. <strong data-star=
t=3D"9147" data-end=3D"9195">Sauvegarde des D=C3=A9p=C3=B4ts dans GitHub En=
terprise</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"9197" data-end=3D"9348" class=3D"">Utilisez l'API GitHub p=
our automatiser les sauvegardes r=C3=A9guli=C3=A8res de vos d=C3=A9p=C3=B4t=
s, ou configurez un syst=C3=A8me de sauvegarde via un fournisseur cloud tie=
rs.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"9350" data-end=3D"9353" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"9355" data-end=3D"9385" class=3D"">8. <strong data-start=
=3D"9361" data-end=3D"9385">Meilleures Pratiques</strong></h2>
<ul data-start=3D"9387" data-end=3D"9592">
<li data-start=3D"9387" data-end=3D"9440" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"9389" data-end=3D"9440" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"9=
389" data-end=3D"9412">Cl=C3=A9 SSH obligatoire</strong> pour tous les util=
isateurs.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"9441" data-end=3D"9524" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"9443" data-end=3D"9524" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"9=
443" data-end=3D"9473">Revue de code syst=C3=A9matique</strong> via PR/MR p=
our garantir la qualit=C3=A9 et la s=C3=A9curit=C3=A9.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"9525" data-end=3D"9592" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"9527" data-end=3D"9592" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"9=
527" data-end=3D"9553">Documentation compl=C3=A8te</strong> du d=C3=A9p=C3=
=B4t (README, CONTRIBUTING, etc.).</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"9594" data-end=3D"9597" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"9599" data-end=3D"9612" class=3D"">Conclusion</h2>
<p data-start=3D"9614" data-end=3D"10002" class=3D"">La gestion des d=C3=A9=
p=C3=B4ts priv=C3=A9s dans un environnement d'entreprise est un =C3=A9l=C3=
=A9ment fondamental pour assurer la s=C3=A9curit=C3=A9, la confidentialit=
=C3=A9, et l'efficacit=C3=A9 de vos projets. En suivant les =C3=A9tapes de =
configuration et en appliquant les bonnes pratiques, vous serez en mesure d=
e g=C3=A9rer et s=C3=A9curiser vos d=C3=A9p=C3=B4ts priv=C3=A9s tout en opt=
imisant les workflows de d=C3=A9veloppement au sein de votre organisation.<=
